# The saga records the opposite of the verdict it then broadcasts, so the
# terminals no longer carry the single TxStatus the saga recorded.
MODULE: AtomicCommit
ROW: NoMixedTerminals
FILE: src/lattice/BPlusTree/Grains/AtomicWriteGrain.cs
DETECTORS: AtomicWriteGrainTests.Committing_saga_broadcasts_its_single_recorded_commit_verdict_to_every_touched_shard
SUMMARY: the recorded decision is the opposite of the verdict the terminals carry

--- FIND
        return TxRegistryWriteRetry.MarkDecisionAsync(registry, txid, committed);
--- REPLACE
        return TxRegistryWriteRetry.MarkDecisionAsync(registry, txid, !committed);
--- END